WEBVTT

00:13.000 --> 00:16.960
Lord Temruogtaf,
I sincerely apologize for the wait.

00:16.960 --> 00:19.920
Lamb baked in a pie crust.

00:22.210 --> 00:25.830
I had grown weary of waiting. Bring it here.

00:37.420 --> 00:39.080
Let's see now.

00:50.080 --> 00:51.580
Delicious!

00:51.580 --> 00:55.380
The spring vegetables splendidly mask
the meat's odd flavor.

00:55.380 --> 00:58.420
The sauce also complements
the dish excellently!

00:59.460 --> 01:01.830
Thank you! Then-

01:01.830 --> 01:03.210
However,

01:03.210 --> 01:07.540
it doesn't hold a candle to your flavor.

01:42.790 --> 01:46.000
Our God demanded that your kind be destroyed.

01:46.000 --> 01:47.580
In other words,

01:47.580 --> 01:53.210
I have free rein to eat
every human in this country!

01:59.290 --> 02:04.130
Now, the largest feast in centuries shall begin!

02:07.380 --> 02:10.670
<b>Episode 2: The Beginning of the Story</b>

02:19.130 --> 02:20.580
The tree froze!

02:20.580 --> 02:22.250
So a dragon is behind this!

02:22.920 --> 02:25.960
Dragons can't attack as long as the sun is out.

02:25.960 --> 02:29.170
Can we not put stock in a basic fact
like that anymore?

02:32.830 --> 02:34.210
That was ten!

02:37.210 --> 02:38.500
It's never-ending.

02:39.920 --> 02:40.830
Crap!

02:43.210 --> 02:44.210
Ragna!

02:50.330 --> 02:51.210
Leo!

02:55.750 --> 02:57.130
What? What was that?

02:57.540 --> 02:58.580
What's that?

03:10.080 --> 03:11.330
I...

03:12.290 --> 03:13.380
Rag...

03:21.250 --> 03:22.210
Ragna!

03:24.130 --> 03:27.250
Ragna! Hey, wait up, Ragna!

03:27.250 --> 03:28.830
Where are you going?

03:29.830 --> 03:31.290
I can't keep up!

03:31.290 --> 03:33.420
Ragna! Hey!

03:33.830 --> 03:35.210
Was I...

03:35.540 --> 03:37.380
Was I asleep?

03:37.380 --> 03:39.130
At a time like this?

03:39.130 --> 03:42.250
After saving Leo, was I so relieved that
I let my guard down and fell asleep?

03:44.170 --> 03:46.790
The danger isn't over yet.

03:47.250 --> 03:48.920
I should've known that!

03:51.920 --> 03:52.790
Hm?

03:53.500 --> 03:57.000
Hey! You there, the silver looking one! Halt!

03:57.000 --> 03:58.880
This is private property!

03:58.880 --> 04:00.670
No further damages will be permit-

04:10.630 --> 04:12.540
I'm cursed.

04:13.000 --> 04:16.000
Everyone close to me gets killed by dragons.

04:16.790 --> 04:19.380
I learned this when I saw into the future.

04:19.750 --> 04:21.420
What should I do?

04:21.420 --> 04:23.750
What can I do to avoid losing everyone?

04:24.420 --> 04:26.080
The obvious solution...

04:26.540 --> 04:28.710
Is to slay every last dragon.

04:28.710 --> 04:30.580
Exterminate every single one from this world!

04:30.580 --> 04:32.040
With my own hands!

04:32.040 --> 04:33.580
That's the only way.

04:33.830 --> 04:35.290
I have to do it.

04:36.130 --> 04:37.330
But...

04:37.330 --> 04:38.960
But can I do it?

04:38.960 --> 04:40.670
Can someone like me do it?

04:40.670 --> 04:43.500
Not even my future self succeeded.

04:43.830 --> 04:45.920
Excuse me. Are you all right?

04:45.920 --> 04:46.920
Huh?

04:51.040 --> 04:54.130
Wh-why are you here?

04:54.130 --> 04:58.330
Huh? Err, um, what-

04:58.330 --> 04:59.750
I get it!

04:59.750 --> 05:02.710
You came to find me, didn't you?

05:02.710 --> 05:04.290
What are you talking about?

05:04.880 --> 05:06.580
Is this just a coincidence?

05:06.960 --> 05:08.250
All right, then.

05:08.580 --> 05:11.080
It saves me the trouble of finding you.

05:11.750 --> 05:13.290
Um...

05:13.290 --> 05:15.920
I'm going to slay all the dragons
in the land now.

05:17.420 --> 05:19.920
Help me do that, Crimson.

05:20.540 --> 05:22.380
Crimson?

05:23.000 --> 05:26.960
I'm sorry. I think you must be
mistaking me for someone else.

05:26.960 --> 05:28.420
My name is Eli-

05:28.420 --> 05:29.630
Eliza Yorkshire.

05:31.130 --> 05:35.170
You're a fourteen-year-old boy
from a farming village.

05:35.170 --> 05:38.670
Your employer's estate was attacked by
a dragon, and you went missing.

05:38.670 --> 05:40.630
Or at least that's your cover story.

05:40.630 --> 05:43.130
That's what your future self told me.

05:43.790 --> 05:46.130
I don't understand what you're talking about.

05:46.130 --> 05:48.540
And my name isn't Eliza, it's Elise.

05:48.540 --> 05:50.500
Your name is Crimson, the Dragon Monarch!

05:51.130 --> 05:53.960
The First Seat. A Winged Monarch.

05:54.710 --> 05:57.540
A former progenitor of
the Blood of the Wing.

05:58.000 --> 06:01.500
And for attempting to kill
the Dragon God, a traitor.

06:02.540 --> 06:04.880
You linked the future and the present

06:04.880 --> 06:08.130
and transferred my future self's power
to my present self.

06:08.130 --> 06:12.750
Your goal is to wipe out all of dragonkind,
including yourself.

06:13.670 --> 06:15.380
I don't know why.

06:15.380 --> 06:17.580
But you were dead-set on it.

06:19.130 --> 06:21.460
Use me, Crimson.

06:22.170 --> 06:24.710
I want to annihilate all dragons too.

06:25.210 --> 06:28.830
Our future selves couldn't pull it off.
Let's triumph this time around!

06:46.710 --> 06:47.670
Huh?

06:47.920 --> 06:50.130
That's enough.

06:50.130 --> 06:52.710
First you called me a man, then a dragon?

06:52.710 --> 06:55.040
You're highly impertinent!

06:58.000 --> 06:59.170
Ragna!

06:59.170 --> 07:00.080
Leo.

07:01.630 --> 07:04.250
Gee, you're so fast!

07:04.250 --> 07:07.080
The trees started falling out of nowhere!

07:07.080 --> 07:09.330
Does that mean the hunt is over alrea-

07:11.250 --> 07:14.710
You worm!

07:17.330 --> 07:20.250
How dare a mere human kick the face of I,

07:20.250 --> 07:23.250
the great Temruogtaf,
the Eighth Seat of the dragons!

07:23.250 --> 07:26.000
What violence!

07:27.580 --> 07:31.670
Now I'll chomp you to bits!

07:38.040 --> 07:39.500
Bombs away.

08:02.630 --> 08:04.080
Are you all right?

08:04.080 --> 08:05.750
Y-yeah.

08:05.750 --> 08:07.380
Oh, okay.

08:07.380 --> 08:12.000
But Ragna, you really have
gotten stronger, haven't you?

08:13.750 --> 08:16.040
Just like I said you would!

08:16.790 --> 08:21.130
The moment I saw you,
I sensed you'd become strong!

08:21.130 --> 08:25.540
Well, I didn't think it'd happen this soon.

08:25.540 --> 08:28.830
It might be difficult for me to
catch up with you now!

08:34.880 --> 08:37.460
Leo, I have a favor to ask.

08:38.130 --> 08:41.830
I want you to take the townsfolk that are
still here and cross the border.

08:42.540 --> 08:43.790
What about you?

08:43.790 --> 08:47.130
I'm going to...
Stay here and take care of something.

08:47.420 --> 08:50.170
I'll meet up with you
as soon as I'm done. So-

08:50.170 --> 08:51.290
No way.

08:52.210 --> 08:54.000
I'm going with you.

08:54.420 --> 08:56.880
What I need to take care of is dangerous.

08:56.880 --> 08:58.670
What do you mean?

08:58.670 --> 09:00.250
We're dragon hunters!

09:00.250 --> 09:02.080
Danger is a part of our job description!

09:02.540 --> 09:04.380
Why are you saying this?

09:04.380 --> 09:06.920
Why are you trying to leave me behind?

09:06.920 --> 09:09.920
Leo, that's not it. Listen to me.

09:09.920 --> 09:11.920
We'll only work separately for a short while.

09:11.920 --> 09:15.040
You're supposed to just do what I tell you!

09:16.880 --> 09:19.960
I didn't... That's not what I...

09:21.460 --> 09:25.750
I've never seen Leo
lose her cool like that before.

09:26.130 --> 09:32.170
She's strong, calm, and
intuitively knows what's right.

09:32.170 --> 09:35.210
She has better judgement and takes action
more decisively than adults.

09:35.750 --> 09:39.080
I have a hunch she'll achieve
truly great things.

09:39.080 --> 09:41.540
But she's just a kid.

09:41.540 --> 09:43.750
She's still only twelve.

09:45.000 --> 09:47.330
But because I was weak and pathetic,

09:47.330 --> 09:50.420
she always had to be stronger
than she needed to be.

09:50.670 --> 09:53.080
You disgust me!

09:53.080 --> 09:57.380
You idolized a little girl as a hero
and leeched off her!

09:57.880 --> 10:00.330
If I really want to protect her...

10:00.330 --> 10:02.960
If I want to see that goal through...

10:03.830 --> 10:06.670
I can't let myself be weak anymore.

10:07.080 --> 10:08.210
Leo.

10:08.710 --> 10:13.040
Do you remember what you said
the very first time we met?

10:14.250 --> 10:16.210
It's not your fault.

10:17.500 --> 10:19.500
The weak die.

10:19.880 --> 10:22.630
Those stronger than the dragons live.

10:22.880 --> 10:26.000
I'm strong, so I won't die.

10:27.290 --> 10:29.290
I'll prove it.

10:29.790 --> 10:31.210
Let's go!

10:37.790 --> 10:40.210
What you said saved me.

10:41.630 --> 10:44.460
Leo, I'm so happy I met you.

10:45.080 --> 10:47.960
But we can't be together anymore.

10:48.630 --> 10:50.710
Don't do this, Ragna!

10:50.710 --> 10:53.000
If you say that, we won't-

10:54.380 --> 10:56.170
You're weak.

10:57.670 --> 10:59.670
You'll die if we stay together.

11:05.420 --> 11:08.250
Ragna!

11:16.880 --> 11:18.130
Leo.

11:22.580 --> 11:24.000
Goodbye.

11:32.540 --> 11:34.880
You awake now, Leonica?

11:34.880 --> 11:36.420
Sykes?

11:36.420 --> 11:37.830
Yeah, it's me.

11:37.830 --> 11:39.170
Got a problem with that?

11:40.380 --> 11:42.330
We left the city.

11:43.380 --> 11:47.380
The only way we can survive
is if we leave the country.

11:47.380 --> 11:48.790
He also...

11:48.790 --> 11:50.880
Ragna also said that.

11:51.040 --> 11:52.460
Ragna...

11:53.630 --> 11:55.170
What happened?

11:57.460 --> 11:59.580
I want to be the strongest!

11:59.580 --> 12:04.500
I distinctly knew that
the first time I held a sword.

12:04.500 --> 12:06.830
That's my purpose.

12:07.380 --> 12:08.960
What about you, Ragna?

12:08.960 --> 12:11.000
Do you have a dream like that?

12:11.670 --> 12:15.540
As long as I'm with you, that's all I need.

12:19.460 --> 12:21.790
I seriously tried to cut him down.

12:22.580 --> 12:28.330
I realized Ragna now has
the ultimate strength I want.

12:28.630 --> 12:33.290
And even if I tried to kill him, I'd fail.

12:33.460 --> 12:35.670
I knew that.

12:36.880 --> 12:38.500
Why?

12:38.500 --> 12:41.580
Why would he leave me?

12:42.210 --> 12:45.420
Don't leave me, Ragna!

12:55.170 --> 12:56.920
Was that how you wanted to do that?

12:56.920 --> 12:59.170
Parting ways with her like that.

12:59.420 --> 13:00.790
It's fine.

13:01.170 --> 13:07.580
I can only be with people's whose deaths
won't hurt me or people who won't die.

13:10.540 --> 13:13.670
Er, I'm going home now-

13:13.670 --> 13:15.830
Please listen to me, Crimson!

13:16.540 --> 13:18.540
I don't know a Crimson!

13:18.540 --> 13:23.540
First off, I'd be dead the moment
the sunlight hit me if I was a dragon!

13:23.540 --> 13:25.420
That's not a problem for you.

13:25.420 --> 13:28.500
Your dragon monarch powers
are blocked off.

13:28.960 --> 13:33.170
Although you can barely use any of
your power, your weaknesses are gone.

13:33.170 --> 13:34.790
That's enough!

13:34.790 --> 13:38.630
You can go fight god or whoever by yourself.

13:38.630 --> 13:40.790
I wish you luck on your hunt.

13:40.790 --> 13:42.250
And as you can see...

13:43.920 --> 13:46.790
I'm a woman!

13:47.540 --> 13:50.540
You can change your sex and age
whenever you like.

13:50.540 --> 13:52.130
I can't!

13:54.790 --> 13:57.790
How am I going to gain Crimson's trust?

13:59.080 --> 14:00.960
Let our paths cross.

14:00.960 --> 14:02.920
That's where this tale begins.

14:02.920 --> 14:06.830
Our paths crossed, but we met earlier
than our future selves did.

14:06.830 --> 14:08.290
But...

14:08.290 --> 14:11.580
I'm not just going to trust you
right off the bat.

14:14.170 --> 14:15.670
Listen to me, Crimson.

14:15.670 --> 14:18.210
Don't appear in front of me
out of nowhere like that!

14:18.420 --> 14:19.790
I can...

14:20.130 --> 14:21.830
Read and write!

14:23.830 --> 14:26.290
Huh? Read and write?

14:26.290 --> 14:28.330
I can do arithmetic and bookkeeping.

14:28.330 --> 14:31.500
I learned how so I could be useful to Leo.

14:32.080 --> 14:33.420
I can also cook.

14:33.420 --> 14:37.210
I'm especially good at cooking all varieties
of meat because Leo loves meat.

14:37.210 --> 14:39.420
I'm also confident in my
vegetable cooking skills.

14:39.420 --> 14:42.290
I came up with methods to make them taste better.
Otherwise, Leo wouldn't eat them.

14:43.040 --> 14:46.580
Cleaning, laundry, sewing, chores.
I know how to do it all!

14:46.580 --> 14:48.790
I learned how to do all these things
so I could take care of Leo!

14:48.790 --> 14:50.670
Why are you telling me this?

14:50.670 --> 14:53.130
I'll do all the scrubbing when you take a bath.

14:52.420 --> 14:53.580
<b>Scrub</b>

14:52.420 --> 14:53.580
<b>Scrub</b>

14:53.130 --> 14:55.380
I'll wash your hair. I'll dry it.

14:53.580 --> 14:55.170
<b>Wush</b>

14:53.580 --> 14:55.170
<b>Wush</b>

14:55.170 --> 14:56.790
<b>Flap</b>

14:55.170 --> 14:56.790
<b>Flap</b>

14:55.380 --> 14:56.580
I'll dress you.

14:56.580 --> 14:59.130
You can count on me to
brush your teeth before bed!

14:56.790 --> 14:58.130
<b>Dress</b>

14:56.790 --> 14:58.130
<b>Dress</b>

14:58.130 --> 14:59.130
<b>Brush</b>

14:58.130 --> 14:59.130
<b>Brush</b>

14:59.420 --> 15:04.420
All the things I've done for Leo
up until now, I'll do for you!

15:04.750 --> 15:07.000
So let's team up and
wipe out all the dragons!

15:07.000 --> 15:08.710
Not a chance.

15:09.000 --> 15:13.630
Speaking of which, Leo is the name of
the child you parted with earlier, right?

15:13.630 --> 15:17.380
And now you're creeping on
other young ladies.

15:17.380 --> 15:19.330
What's going on in your head?

15:19.330 --> 15:20.920
No, you're a man.

15:20.920 --> 15:24.080
I cannot fulfill your expectations.

15:24.080 --> 15:25.170
I apologize.

15:28.880 --> 15:31.420
Hey, what's wrong?

15:36.540 --> 15:38.080
That's an awful fever.

15:42.000 --> 15:44.130
You're unconscious, huh?

16:04.750 --> 16:08.960
It's impressive for a human body
to reach that level of power.

16:10.710 --> 16:14.500
I'm so impressed, it's almost irksome.

16:14.790 --> 16:16.460
Who are you?

16:16.460 --> 16:17.830
The Dragon Monarch, Crimson.

16:20.130 --> 16:23.580
I came here today to make a proposal.

16:26.670 --> 16:30.040
Let's join forces, Ragna the Reaper.

16:33.580 --> 16:35.000
Let's form a united front.

16:35.000 --> 16:36.790
Together, we can exterminate all drag-

16:40.960 --> 16:42.960
I can use...

16:43.130 --> 16:45.630
your strength much more effectively...

16:45.830 --> 16:47.960
than you ever could.

16:51.630 --> 16:53.380
Are you awake now?

16:54.500 --> 16:58.290
After all, I couldn't just desert
the man who saved my life.

17:01.130 --> 17:02.790
I was asleep?

17:02.790 --> 17:05.580
Is my body not yet used to fighting
with Silverine Battle Arts?

17:06.420 --> 17:08.080
What do you think, Crimson?

17:08.080 --> 17:09.920
I'm not Crimson.

17:10.960 --> 17:15.330
Is it true what that dragon said
about destroying the kingdom?

17:15.330 --> 17:16.830
It's true.

17:16.830 --> 17:19.290
That's why we need to start hunting
all the dragons in the land now.

17:19.290 --> 17:23.040
But most importantly, we need to hunt down
the Winged Monarch that leads them.

17:23.040 --> 17:24.830
You're kidding, right?

17:24.830 --> 17:26.460
Our future selves pulled it off.

17:29.420 --> 17:31.670
Over twenty years in the future.

17:32.460 --> 17:35.210
But this time, we'll be able to do it faster.

17:35.210 --> 17:37.750
Because we've already met.

17:43.630 --> 17:46.460
A human who knows about my true form...

17:46.460 --> 17:49.130
"Our future selves," he said.

17:49.130 --> 17:51.830
Nothing like this has ever happened before.

17:52.290 --> 17:54.790
But this seems entertaining.

17:55.630 --> 18:00.130
While he was asleep, I examined his body
and learned two things.

18:00.540 --> 18:03.830
His body is fused with a silver sword.

18:03.830 --> 18:08.080
He doesn't shroud himself in silverine,
but generates and emits it.

18:08.080 --> 18:09.750
It's unclear how it works.

18:09.750 --> 18:11.920
And his potential is...

18:12.670 --> 18:15.540
Unbelievably high!

18:16.330 --> 18:18.040
I want to test this out!

18:18.040 --> 18:19.830
An unknown method of killing dragons!

18:19.830 --> 18:21.040
I wanna kill them!

18:21.040 --> 18:22.000
Kill them!

18:22.000 --> 18:23.210
I wanna kill them all!

18:23.710 --> 18:27.500
How long has it been since I felt this excited?

18:28.540 --> 18:29.460
Well...

18:35.580 --> 18:36.960
What's over there?

18:37.170 --> 18:39.830
That's the direction everyone
in town was heading.

18:41.330 --> 18:43.920
You don't suppose everyone was attacked?

18:45.130 --> 18:46.250
Not on my watch.

18:46.250 --> 18:47.000
Huh?

18:47.000 --> 18:48.080
Huh? What?

18:48.080 --> 18:49.040
Unbelievable!

18:53.540 --> 18:55.040
Do you have any orders?

18:55.630 --> 18:57.580
If you have any special orders,
I'll obey you.

18:57.580 --> 18:59.000
Interesting!

18:59.710 --> 19:01.040
I'm not Crimson,

19:01.040 --> 19:03.790
but obliterate them!

19:03.790 --> 19:05.000
Roger that.

19:41.040 --> 19:42.750
Silverine Battle Arts.

20:03.460 --> 20:05.960
The sword itself is a shabby piece of work.

20:05.960 --> 20:09.380
But it can freeze an ordinary dragon
to the bone with just a touch.

20:09.790 --> 20:13.170
It's potent enough that even a
second-rate dragon hunter

20:13.170 --> 20:15.380
could probably kill superior dragons with it.

20:16.250 --> 20:18.290
This is beyond any individual's strength alone.

20:18.290 --> 20:20.330
This is a vast, deep power.

20:21.630 --> 20:24.750
This sword points to one possibility.

20:25.330 --> 20:28.540
If we could equip an army
with similar weapons,

20:28.540 --> 20:32.170
and I could control that army...

20:41.000 --> 20:43.000
Go, my servant.

20:45.380 --> 20:47.750
Purururu!

20:48.000 --> 20:51.210
Slime was in Crimson's stomach, huh?

20:51.500 --> 20:52.790
Purururururururu!

20:52.790 --> 20:54.710
It's time for me to be usheful!

21:03.080 --> 21:04.920
Silence, you nothings!

21:09.080 --> 21:11.130
You're in the presence of your lord.

21:12.250 --> 21:14.420
Be silent and die.

21:23.790 --> 21:26.000
I knew you were Crimson.

21:26.290 --> 21:28.040
Your name is Ragna?

21:28.040 --> 21:31.210
I'm willing to accept your offer
to join forces.

21:31.210 --> 21:32.580
Under one condition.

21:35.250 --> 21:36.960
That's poison.

21:36.960 --> 21:39.750
You'll die in throes of agony if you drink it.

21:40.250 --> 21:41.790
But don't fret.

21:41.790 --> 21:46.920
This effect will only take place
if you try to rebel against me.

21:47.290 --> 21:49.710
Your power poses a threat to me.

21:49.710 --> 21:51.790
I need insurance.

21:51.790 --> 21:56.960
If you wish for me to use you,
drink that poison here and n-

21:58.330 --> 21:59.670
Already did.

21:59.960 --> 22:02.380
You didn't hesitate in the slightest.

22:02.380 --> 22:04.170
What compels you to act this way?

22:04.170 --> 22:06.750
Why are you so intent on
eradicating the dragons?

22:07.170 --> 22:08.670
To protect.

22:08.670 --> 22:10.920
So I can protect all the things
my future self lost.

22:10.920 --> 22:13.210
And so I can protect all the things
I'm destined to lose.

22:13.210 --> 22:14.580
So I can protect all of it!

22:15.040 --> 22:17.290
That's why I want to exterminate them all!

22:17.290 --> 22:18.130
Hah!

22:18.130 --> 22:22.540
So you want to destroy your enemies first
because you fear being hurt?

22:22.540 --> 22:25.080
You're such a dull guy!

22:25.080 --> 22:28.380
You don't seem to have the makings of a hero.

22:28.380 --> 22:32.460
But you do show some promise, as a tool.

22:33.080 --> 22:35.080
I'll use you.

22:35.080 --> 22:37.080
I'll guide you...

22:37.540 --> 22:39.960
down the path of my blood's extinction.

22:40.500 --> 22:47.920
Wing. Scale. Claw. Roar. Eye. Bone.

22:49.880 --> 22:52.790
We'll butcher the six bloodlines.

22:52.790 --> 22:55.380
Then, we'll slay God!

22:56.170 --> 22:57.670
We'll slice them up with silver blades!

22:57.670 --> 22:59.210
We'll burn them in the sunlight!

22:59.210 --> 23:01.290
We won't leave them with
a single drop of blood!

23:01.630 --> 23:05.250
Oh. I've heard these words
before in the future.

23:05.250 --> 23:09.830
Entomb every last person and thing
associated with dragonkind!

23:09.830 --> 23:11.000
Bury it all!

23:11.250 --> 23:13.420
We'll prevail this time.

23:13.830 --> 23:20.290
And when everything has been
reduced to ashes, my life shall-

23:20.290 --> 23:21.580
I know!

23:22.960 --> 23:24.880
When it's all over, I'll slay you.

23:25.330 --> 23:26.830
Magnificent!

23:27.130 --> 23:28.830
Let us begin...

23:28.830 --> 23:31.330
the battle that will change
the fate of the world...

23:32.080 --> 23:36.000
and the tale of how you and I
exterminate all dragons.
